    rdf:value """Thursday, March 2, 1916, I Tatti
Home
Still in bed. Fever less .
Lina came to see me - also the elusive Yoï, who seems always fake and un-intimate. 
Young Lehman and his friend Walter Seligman came to see B.B. Also Nello. """^^xsd:string ;
